.md", "source_location": "L41-L55", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "PR checks run on self-hosted homelab-check runners; without one the PR ci job queues forever. Runner playbook requires the fork PR approval policy all_external_contributors."}, {"id": "docs_release_bump_secrets", "label": "HOMELAB_BUMP_APP_ID / HOMELAB_BUMP_APP_KEY secrets", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/release.md", "source_location": "L57-L64", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_release_main_ruleset", "label": "main branch ruleset (Cooking-Hub shape)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/release.md", "source_location": "L66-L100", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Applied after the bootstrap push because required checks refuse direct pushes to main; blocks deletion and non-fast-forward, requires ci / ci plus three security-baseline checks, strict."}, {"id": "docs_release_creative_archive_deploy", "label": "Homelab creative-archive-deploy live change", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/release.md", "source_location": "L124-L136", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "LXC host creative-archive01, creative_archive role, env template with PROTOCOL_HEADER=x-forwarded-proto and BODY_SIZE_LIMIT=17M, nginx 17m, sqlite_backups registered by hand; Terraform apply gated by infrastructure approval since LXC creation is hard to reverse."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_release_cutting_a_release", "target": "docs_release_ci_workflow", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/release.md", "source_location": "L7", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_release_cutting_a_release", "target": "docs_release_release_workflow", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "sourc